    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>Add and manage over 1000 apps using Azure Active Directory.&nbsp; <a href=\"https://azuremarketplace.microsoft.com/en-us/marketplace/apps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Check out the list of apps</a>, or add an app&nbsp;using the Azure Management portal to see it in the app gallery.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://azurecomcdn.azureedge.net/mediahandler/acomblog/updates/ServiceUpdates/imported/images-2014-03-AppGallery.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img alt=\"AppGallery\" src=\"https://azurecomcdn.azureedge.net/mediahandler/acomblog/updates/ServiceUpdates/imported/images-2014-03-AppGallery-300x209.png\"></a> &nbsp;</p>\r\n",
